--- Analysis: Why not use the deepest setup? ---
A setup with Max_depth=20 is better than 67.2% of all configurations.
Reasoning: This setup is better than 67.2% of all available configurations because its predicted performance metrics are closer to the ideal target values than most other observed setups.
Conclusion: Simply increasing complexity (depth) does not guarantee optimal performance, as the relationship between inputs and goals is non-linear and often noisy.

